WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.057
Tina: A waterslide! They are so much fun.

2
00:00:15.058 --> 00:00:17.188
Brad: You’re both crazy.

3
00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:20.488
You don’t know where it leads.

4
00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:22.694
Danny: It has to lead somewhere.

5
00:00:22.695 --> 00:00:24.882
I think we should try it.

6
00:00:24.883 --> 00:00:27.203
Tina: I’ll go first! Ready?

7
00:00:27.204 --> 00:00:32.602
Start right after me, Brad!

8
00:00:32.603 --> 00:00:34.644
Danny: You better go, Brad.

9
00:00:34.645 --> 00:00:36.657
We don’t want to lose her.

10
00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:46.663
Danny: One, two, three! I’m right behind you!

11
00:00:46.664 --> 00:00:50.040
Tina: Wheee! This is incredible!

12
00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:53.124
Brad: I think I’m going to be sick.

13
00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:57.389
Danny: This is more fun than being in class!

14
00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.796
Brad: Whoo-hoo!

15
00:00:59.797 --> 00:01:05.326
Danny: That’s the spirit, Brad.

16
00:01:05.327 --> 00:01:10.718
Tina: It’s about time we had fun!

17
00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:13.084
Danny: Which way do we go?

18
00:01:13.085 --> 00:01:14.743
Tina: I don’t know!

19
00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:17.280
Brad, what do you think?

20
00:01:17.281 --> 00:01:19.550
Brad: How should I know?!

21
00:01:19.551 --> 00:01:23.874
Danny: Somebody decide quickly!

22
00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:27.394
Tina: This way!

23
00:01:27.395 --> 00:01:30.071
Brad: What if we went the wrong way?

24
00:01:30.072 --> 00:01:33.499
Tina: Then this won’t be much fun anymore.

25
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.602
Danny: We haven’t done too badly, so far.

26
00:01:37.603 --> 00:01:44.178
Brad: Oh yeah? Well, just look ahead.

27
00:01:44.179 --> 00:01:46.335
All three: Aaah!

28
00:01:46.336 --> 00:01:48.796
Tina: Danny . . . this isn’t good.

29
00:01:48.797 --> 00:01:54.110
Brad: Yeah. Now would be a good time to use your imagination again.

30
00:01:54.111 --> 00:01:56.574
Danny: I’ve got an idea!

31
00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.681
Hold on to me!

32
00:01:58.682 --> 00:02:00.164
Brad: What?

33
00:02:00.165 --> 00:02:03.324
Danny: You and Tina. Hold on to me!

34
00:02:03.325 --> 00:02:06.542
Tina: This better work!

35
00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:08.297
Brad: Oh no!

36
00:02:08.298 --> 00:02:12.812
Tina: Danny, do something!

37
00:02:12.813 --> 00:02:20.888
Danny: Both of you, start blowing.

38
00:02:20.889 --> 00:02:23.546
Tina: You’re a genius, Danny!

39
00:02:23.547 --> 00:02:26.420
Brad: Hey, I’m the smart one.

40
00:02:26.421 --> 00:02:35.973
Danny: More blowing, less talking!

41
00:02:35.974 --> 00:02:41.801
Danny: That’s it, I think we’ve stopped falling.

42
00:02:41.802 --> 00:02:48.361
Brad: I . . . can’t . . . blow . . . anymore!

43
00:02:48.362 --> 00:02:55.084
Tina: I’m . . . out of . . . breath . . . too!

44
00:02:55.085 --> 00:02:58.711
Danny: Don’t stop now, you guys!

45
00:02:58.712 --> 00:03:01.346
Tina: Everybody blow!

46
00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:05.482
Danny: Hurry!

47
00:03:05.483 --> 00:03:11.021
Brad: Oh no!
